        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tanks: 1985 is a retro-inspired tank battle game built for both nostalgic players and new fans. Blast through enemy forces, defend your base, and enjoy exciting modern features that bring classic arcade action to life!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🕹️ <strong>Game Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>72 Classic Levels</strong> – Play solo or with a friend in local co-op.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiplayer Battles</strong> – Create rooms, invite friends, or jump into Quick Match (with bots if needed).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Custom Maps</strong> – Design, edit, and play your own maps.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Community Shop</strong> – Buy and sell maps with other players.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >⚡ Modern Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Powerup Wheel</strong> – Spend coins mid-battle to activate shields, speed boosts, and more!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Emoji Wheel</strong> – Send quick emojis like “OK 👍”, “Laugh 😂”, “Angry 😡”, or “🛡️ Defend Base” to other players during online matches.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Modern Economy</strong> – Earn coins by playing or purchase via Steam microtransactions.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >💥 <strong>Why Tanks: 1985?</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nostalgic retro graphics with pixel-perfect style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Modern quality-of-life features (matchmaking, achievements, Steam integration).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A thriving community where creativity (map editor) meets competition.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >👉 Whether you're defending your base solo, teaming up with friends, competing online, or showing off your custom maps, Tanks: 1985 delivers a perfect blend of retro action and modern multiplayer fun.</p></li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tanks: 1985 is a retro-inspired tank battle game built for both nostalgic players and new fans. Blast through enemy forces, defend your base, and enjoy exciting modern features that bring classic arcade action to life!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🕹️ <strong>Game Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>72 Classic Levels</strong> – Play solo or with a friend in local co-op.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiplayer Battles</strong> – Create rooms, invite friends, or jump into Quick Match (with bots if needed).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Custom Maps</strong> – Design, edit, and play your own maps.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Community Shop</strong> – Buy and sell maps with other players.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >⚡ Modern Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Powerup Wheel</strong> – Spend coins mid-battle to activate shields, speed boosts, and more!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Emoji Wheel</strong> – Send quick emojis like “OK 👍”, “Laugh 😂”, “Angry 😡”, or “🛡️ Defend Base” to other players during online matches.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Modern Economy</strong> – Earn coins by playing or purchase via Steam microtransactions.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >💥 <strong>Why Tanks: 1985?</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nostalgic retro graphics with pixel-perfect style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Modern quality-of-life features (matchmaking, achievements, Steam integration).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A thriving community where creativity (map editor) meets competition.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >👉 Whether you're defending your base solo, teaming up with friends, competing online, or showing off your custom maps, Tanks: 1985 delivers a perfect blend of retro action and modern multiplayer fun.</p></li></ul>",
